# A Ccratch arrangement: the blocks the way a kernel source reads.
# Columns, left to right. Each takes some kinds of things:
#   includes macros types globals protos main funcs classes loose rest
# in an order (| order=file, name, size or calls) and, if it gets taller
# than wrap=HEIGHT, goes on in a column beside it, like a newspaper.
@name    = Kernel style
@name.ru = Как в ядре
column = includes macros
column = types globals protos
column = funcs main | order=calls wrap=2400
column = classes loose rest
